{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43504","headline":"人不易知 · 无名氏","name":"人不易知","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"权衡谅匪易，愚智信难移。\n九德皆殊进，三端岂易施。\n同称崑岫宝，共握桂林枝。\n郑鼠今奚别，齐竽或滥吹。\n瑶台有光监，屡照不应疲。\n片善当无掩，先鸣贵在斯。\n龙门峻且极，骥足庶来驰。\n太息李元礼，期君幸一知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43504.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43504","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}